.TH GETUID 3F
.UC
.SH NAME
getuid, getgid \- get user or group ID of the caller
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B integer function getuid()
.sp 1
.B integer function getgid()
.SH DESCRIPTION
These functions return the real user or group ID of the user
of the process.
.SH FILES
/usr/lib/libU77.a
.SH "SEE ALSO"
getuid(2)
